  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organising to advance domestic workers&apos; rights and dignity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The International Domestic Workers Federation (IDWF) is a global organization that operates on a membership basis and focuses on the rights of domestic and household workers. A domestic or household worker is defined as any individual engaged in domestic work within an employment relationship. 
We firmly believe that domestic work is legitimate work, and that all domestic and household workers deserve the same rights as any other workers. 
The project objective is to build a strong, democratic, and unified global organization for domestic and household workers aimed at protecting and promoting their rights everywhere.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
